# Exported constants: scalars, structs, aggregates (shared + mutable through
# the reference), the result of, optionals; readable inside the importer's
# functions; dependency init runs first.
use answer, greeting, origin, table, counts, doubled, nothing, origin_x, Point from "data"
say "main start"
say answer, greeting, origin, doubled, nothing
say x of origin
function show_table is
    say table, answer + 1
    append 4 to table
end function
show_table
say table
change value of "b" in counts to 2
say counts
constant ox is the result of origin_x
say ox
constant p is make Point with x 5, y 6
say p is origin
